repository-code: "https://github.com/h0nda1337/caribeos-xnu-rv32"
version: "Tranche 201"
abstract: >-
  Experimental port of Apple open-source XNU 2050.48.11 to RV32IMACSU,
  including Sv32, two-hart SMP, a Linux-compatible process personality,
  musl integration, and interactive GNU Bash through the companion runtime.
keywords:
  - XNU
  - RISC-V
  - RV32IMACSU
  - operating systems
  - kernel
  - SMP
  - Sv32
